v 3
d 'TABTOOLS': Suite of table export commands for publication-ready Excel and Markdown output
d
d tabtools is a comprehensive suite of Stata commands for exporting
d tables to professionally formatted Excel and Markdown files. Includes:
d
d   table1_tc      - Descriptive statistics (Table 1) with automatic tests
d   desctab        - Consolidated descriptive table engine
d   tabtools       - Suite controller and persistent defaults manager
d   regtab         - Regression results from any model
d   effecttab      - Treatment effects and margins results
d   stratetab      - Incidence rates from strate output
d   hrcomptab      - Compatibility wrapper for comptab rate-scaffold mode
d   comptab        - Vertical model composites and rate-interlocked tables
d   survtab        - Kaplan-Meier survival estimates and medians
d   crosstab       - Cross-tabulation with association measures
d   corrtab        - Correlation matrix with significance stars
d   puttab         - Style an in-memory dataset, frame, or matrix as one sheet
d   stacktab       - Assemble multi-sheet composite Excel tables from blocks
d   tabtools_tips  - Quick reference and worked recipes
d
d Commands apply consistent Excel formatting and can emit GitHub-Flavored
d Markdown tables for report workflows.
d
d Requires: Stata version 17+ (all commands)
d Optional: eplot for forest plots from comptab/hrcomptab companion frames
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260905
d License: MIT
d
d Author: Timothy P Copeland, Karolinska Institutet
d
